From 2541f9f58c90f58b0244ad3a50a6a552ef548942 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 18:38:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 32/43] Modern abilities, batch 4: modern behaviour for Gen 3
 abilities

Sturdy survives a KO from full HP; Lightning Rod absorbs Electric moves
for +1 Sp. Atk; Drizzle/Drought/Sand Stream set 5-turn weather;
Intimidate is blocked by Inner Focus, Own Tempo, Oblivious and Scrappy;
Oblivious blocks Taunt; Keen Eye ignores evasion boosts; Rough Skin does
1/8; Effect Spore spares Grass types and Overcoat; Plus/Minus work with
either partner; Stench has a 10% flinch; Trace exclusions; Ghost types
escape trapping; Shadow Tag doesn't trap Shadow Tag.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
